WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:17.290
Daisy: I like your necklace, Miss Gray.

2
00:00:17.291 --> 00:00:19.027
Kara: Me too.

3
00:00:19.028 --> 00:00:22.535
Miss Gray: Thank you. It's from my trip to Africa.

4
00:00:22.536 --> 00:00:25.625
Coby: Wow. You went to Africa?

5
00:00:25.626 --> 00:00:27.276
Miss Gray: Yes.

6
00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:29.190
Coby: Did you see lions?

7
00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:31.807
Miss Gray: Yes, and elephants.

8
00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:35.279
Miss Gray: This necklace reminds me of my trip.

9
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:41.542
Miss Gray: It was wonderful.

10
00:00:41.543 --> 00:00:45.164
Daisy: I can't stop thinking about Miss Gray's necklace, Mom.

11
00:00:45.165 --> 00:00:49.101
Daisy: It has such pretty beads.

12
00:00:49.102 --> 00:00:52.603
Mrs. Gomez: Why don't you make your own necklace?

13
00:00:52.604 --> 00:00:54.301
Daisy: How?

14
00:00:54.302 --> 00:00:57.677
Mrs. Gomez: We can buy some beads and string them together.

15
00:00:57.678 --> 00:01:02.138
Daisy: Oh, cool! Can my friends make something too?

16
00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:05.141
Mrs. Gomez: Sure. We'll have a party!

17
00:01:05.142 --> 00:01:07.347
Daisy: Yay! A bead party.

18
00:01:07.348 --> 00:01:16.406
I can't wait!

19
00:01:16.407 --> 00:01:18.370
Eve, Maya, and Jenna: Hi, Daisy!

20
00:01:18.371 --> 00:01:20.367
Daisy: Come on in, everybody.

21
00:01:20.368 --> 00:01:33.218
The party is about to start!

22
00:01:33.219 --> 00:01:36.373
Mrs. Gomez: Sit down, girls.

23
00:01:36.374 --> 00:01:39.339
I'll help you get started.

24
00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:41.926
Daisy: We can make pretty things.

25
00:01:41.927 --> 00:01:49.837
Things like Miss Gray's necklace.

26
00:01:49.838 --> 00:01:53.136
Eve: I made a sparkly bracelet.

27
00:01:53.137 --> 00:01:54.809
See the pattern?

28
00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:59.272
Eve: Pink, white, pink, white, green!

29
00:01:59.273 --> 00:02:01.339
Daisy: Look at my necklace.

30
00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:11.493
I used animal beads.

31
00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:15.251
Coby: Whoa. Nice necklace, Maya.

32
00:02:15.252 --> 00:02:17.902
I like those soccer balls.

33
00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:24.671
Maya: Thanks. Daisy made an animal necklace.

34
00:02:24.672 --> 00:02:28.527
Maya: And Eve made a pretty bracelet.

35
00:02:28.528 --> 00:02:34.243
Maya: Yeah. We made everything at Daisy's party.

36
00:02:34.244 --> 00:02:38.949
Kara: What? Daisy had a party?

37
00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:42.212
Maya: Yes! A bead party.

38
00:02:42.213 --> 00:02:44.504
It was fun!

39
00:02:44.505 --> 00:02:48.406
Kara: Hmpf!
